      "comment": "LAVERS GINNY (6) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 0.9 lengths from the winner Winnaleah (16.93) at this track. The form out of her last race has been franked. Key chance in this line up. DIM SIM NODDY (4) was fresh up last time at this track where he finished seventh (17.02) in a Grade 5. Solid record here winning four races. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Should be in this for a long way. FERREL'S LAW (3) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when third beaten 0.8 lengths (17.22). Will give a great sight again. ABRACADABRA (2) drops in trip and warrants respect.",
